        <h2 style="color: #132441; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Event stream destination paused</h2>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">Hello,</p>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">
          We paused the destination <strong style="color: #132441;"><%= @destination.name %></strong>
          for project <strong style="color: #132441;"><%= @destination.project.name %></strong>
          after 24 hours of failed deliveries.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: #fdecec; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 30px 0; border: 1px solid #f5b5b5;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0; color: #132441; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;">Last error</h4>
          <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; color: #6b7c93; font-size: 13px;"><%= @destination.last_error.presence || "Unknown" %></p>

          <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="<%= @settings_url %>"
               style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2A86FF; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px;">
              Open event stream settings
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">
          Fix the endpoint, then resume the destination from the dashboard or the API. Delivery continues from where it stopped;
          events are kept for <strong style="color: #132441;">7 days</strong>.
        </p>
